            },
            "displayName": "Martin Seitz",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Yep! That did it. I applied the three patches (I had to modify them slightly for release 1.4.3) and it works - the test cases as well as my application.",
